.claude/worktrees/
# Linked worktrees created with `git worktree add .worktrees/<name>` (2026-11-06: three
# registered worktrees there showed as untracked in every dirty-tree scan). NOT _archive/:
# completed archive records under _archive/ are tracked by convention (584 files).
.worktrees/

# Eval-harness daily run output (Rev 10 R10-2, 2026-08-14): writes a run JSON +
# a summary.csv row on every daily fire, which made this single-writer checkout
# show uncommitted work every day (false-positive against the shared-checkout
# protocol) and would have committed ~365 JSONs/yr. Machine-local run state,
# not source of truth.
acquisition-underwriting-eval-harness/runs/
# pytest run state (never skill content; package_skills.is_bundled also excludes it)
.pytest_cache/

